{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-work-wp-portfolio-slug-jsx","path":"/work/gamesys/","result":{"data":{"wpPortfolio":{"title":"GAMESYS","content":"<p>I spent 9 months working with Gamesys from 2016-2017, developing a wide range of complex banners &amp; animations to promote the online games of Gamesys, using ReactJS, Javascript, Greensock and the canvas object for a range of different ad servers. Some of the ads were very processor-intensive, so a great deal of time was spent investigating the best tech approach. Other ads were made dynamic in order for non-technical people to easily amend all the content within the creatives. In addition, I built a range of JS animations for promotional campaigns….</p>\n","slug":"gamesys","url":{"url":"http://asiegeofherons.co.uk/birthday/"},"image1":{"image1":{"mediaDetails":{"sizes":[{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/rainbowriches-1-300x185.png","width":"300","name":"medium"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/rainbowriches-1-150x150.png","width":"150","name":"thumbnail"}]}}},"image2":{"image2":{"mediaDetails":{"sizes":[{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/gamesys_main-1-300x74.png","width":"300","name":"medium"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/gamesys_main-1-150x150.png","width":"150","name":"thumbnail"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/gamesys_main-1-768x189.png","width":"768","name":"medium_large"}]}}},"image3":{"image3":null},"image4":{"image4":null},"image5":{"image5":null}},"seoPage":{"nodeType":"Portfolio","title":"GAMESYS","uri":"/portfolio/gamesys/","seo":{"title":"GAMESYS - My Blog","metaDesc":"","focuskw":"","metaKeywords":"","metaRobotsNoindex":"index","metaRobotsNofollow":"follow","opengraphTitle":"GAMESYS - My Blog","opengraphDescription":"I spent 9 months working with Games